OL,3,ARussian warship hit by Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Ain Gulf of Finland
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinnish officials have confirmed that a
OL,7,FRussian warship was attacked in the
OL,8,FGulf of Finland on Wednesday, although
OL,9,Flittle is known about the strike.
OL,11,FUkraine's SBU security service said it
OL,12,Ftargeted the ship Naro-Fominsk as part
OL,13,Fof a broader drone operation against
OL,14,FRussia's Ust-Luga oil export depot on
OL,15,Fthe Baltic coast.
OL,17,FThe attack, thought to be the first
OL,18,Ftime Ukrainian drones have attacked a
OL,19,FRussian ship in an area of the Baltic
OL,20,FSea open to civilian maritime traffic,
OL,21,Fhas raised questions about whether
OL,22,FUkraine could expand its strikes.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
