OL,3,ARussian warship hit by Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Ain Gulf of Finland
OL,5,
OL,6,FHelsinki has been one of Kyiv's closest
OL,7,FEuropean allies, and Finnish officials
OL,8,Fhave described the incident as a direct
OL,9,Fresult of Russia's continued full-scale
OL,10,Fwar.
